0	section	Talking to Timfraku
# Edited (Authored, not Wiki): every identity reaches the menu below, and gold / So far?? reach the start prompt.
1	line	Timfraku	I am the Chief of Tai Bwo Wannai Village! Who dares set foot in my hut?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	I am a roving adventurer.
2	line	Player	I am a roving adventurer.
2	line	Timfraku	Well then adventurer, you would do better to rove elsewhere.
2	action	continue
1	option	I am a travelling explorer.
2	line	Player	I am a travelling explorer.
2	line	Timfraku	Well then explorer, you would do better to travel elsewhere.
2	action	continue
1	option	I am a wandering wayfarer.
2	line	Player	I am a wandering wayfarer.
2	line	Timfraku	Well then wayfarer, you would do better to wander elsewhere.
2	action	continue
1	option	Who me? Oh I'm just a nobody.
2	line	Player	Who me? Oh I'm just a nobody.
2	line	Timfraku	Well then NoBody, you would do better to go elsewhere.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Why should I leave?
2	line	Player	Why should I leave?
2	line	Timfraku	This place has been cursed. Our people have angered the gods and have fled the village.
2	select	Select an option
2	option	Where is this place?
3	line	Player	Where is this place?
3	line	Timfraku	You ask too many questions. Now begone!
3	action	end
2	option	Who are the gods?
3	line	Player	Who are the gods?
3	line	Timfraku	You ask too many questions! Now begone!
3	action	end
2	option	Where have your people fled to?
3	line	Player	Where have your people fled to?
3	line	Timfraku	You ask too many questions. Now begone!
3	action	end
1	option	Right, I'm going then.
2	line	Player	Right, I'm going then.
2	action	end
1	option	Trufitus sent me.
2	line	Player	Trufitus sent me.
2	line	Timfraku	Trufitus Shakaya? What news does he send?
2	line	Player	Trufitus has communed with the gods. Your village was never cursed and your people are free to return.
2	line	Timfraku	Bwana, do you speak the truth?
2	line	Player	Yes, I helped Trufitus gather ingredients for a commune potion.
2	box	Timfraku appears to concentrate very deeply.
2	line	Timfraku	Then it must be true.
2	line	Timfraku	I cannot thank you enough for what you have done so far.
2	select	Select an option
2	option	Your gratitude is all I deserve.
3	line	Player	Your gratitude is all I deserve.
3	line	Timfraku	No, Bwana, you deserve much more.
3	line	Timfraku	I now ask you to do one last thing for our village.
3	line	Player	And what is that?
3	line	Timfraku	I ask you to deliver the good news to my three sons Tamayu, Tinsay & Tiadeche, and then return them to the village.
3	select	Start the Tai Bwo Wannai Trio quest?
3	option	Yes.
4	line	Player	Ok, I'll do it.
4	line	Timfraku	Thank you very much. I shall reward you greatly if you succeed.
4	line	Player	If I succeed? How hard can it be?
4	line	Timfraku	We shall see, Bwana.
4	action	end
3	option	No.
4	line	Player	No, I've had quite enough of the jungle already.
4	line	Timfraku	Very well. Return when you are ready.
4	action	end
2	option	Well, some gold would be nice.
3	line	Player	Well, some gold would be nice.
