2	option	Ask about Village.
3	select	Select an option
3	option	What do you do here?
4	line	Player	What do you do here?
4	line	Timfraku	It should be clear to anyone that I am the chief of Tai Bwo Wannai. I ensure that things run smoothly in this village.
3	option	Is there anything interesting to do here?
4	line	Player	Is there anything interesting to do here?
4	line	Timfraku	Yes Bwana, plenty of interesting things to do. Firstly you could make an effort to tidy the place up a little. Equip yourself with a machete and start cutting down the jungle that seems to be growing all around here.
4	line	Timfraku	Go and have a chat with Murcaily for information, he's tending the hardwood grove to the east of here.
4	action	initial
3	option	I've been doing some work around the village.
4	line	Player	I've been doing some work around the village.
4	cond	If the player has not been doing the Tai Bwo Wannai Cleanup tasks:
5	line	Timfraku	That's good Bwana, I would hate to think that you were just being lazy while you're in my kingdom!
5	action	initial
4	cond	If the player has completed at least one task from the Tai Bwo Wannai Cleanup task list:
3	option	Ok, thanks.
4	line	Player	Ok, thanks.
4	action	end
