2	cond	If the Agility potion does not have four doses:
2	action	above
2	cond	If the player asks to take them to his next battle:
3	line	Tamayu	I am beginning to match Shaikahan's agility!
3	line	Tamayu	I cannot do enough damage ...
3	line	Tamayu	... and it seems to be healing too quickly!
3	action	end
1	cond	If the player uses an iron or better spear on Tamayu:
2	line	Player	Tamayu, try using this weapon.
2	box	You hand the spear to Tamayu.
2	line	Tamayu	Thank you Bwana. Now I must prepare for my next hunt.
2	cond	If the player asks to take them to their next hunt with the iron spear (or better):
3	line	Tamayu	Shaikhan is at present far too agile for me!
3	line	Tamayu	I can do enough damage ...
3	line	Tamayu	... but it seems to be healing too quickly!
3	action	end
1	cond	If the player hands a partially full agility potion on Tamayu after handing the better spear:
