3	line	Tamayu	Thank you Bwana. Now I must prepare for my next hunt.
3	line	Tamayu	I feel much more agile, but I am not sure whether I can match the Shaikahan...
3	action	end
2	cond	If the Agility potion has two doses:
3	box	You hand over the agility potion to Tamayu.
3	line	Tamayu	Thank you Bwana. Now I must prepare for my next hunt.
3	line	Tamayu	I feel much more agile, but I am not sure whether I can match the Shaikahan...
3	action	end
2	cond	If the Agility potion has three doses:
3	box	You hand over the agility potion to Tamayu.
3	line	Tamayu	Thank you Bwana. Now I must prepare for my next hunt.
3	line	Tamayu	I feel much more agile, but I am not sure whether I can match the Shaikahan...
3	action	end
