1	line	Lubufu	Watch where you're going, young whippersnapper!
1	option	I wasn't going anywhere...
2	line	Player	I wasn't going anywhere...
2	line	Lubufu	Well then go away from here!
2	action	end
1	option	What's a whippersnapper?
