2	action	end
1	option	Who are you?
2	line	Lubufu	I am Lubufu - the only fisherman who knows the secret of the Karambwan!
2	line	Player	What's a Karambwan?
2	line	Lubufu	What a foolish question! Now leave!
2	action	end
