0	section	Reaching Tinsay
1	cond	If the player attempts to climb the rocks from the sides:
2	box	You can't do that from here.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player falls on the rocks:
2	box	You fall and hurt yourself.
2	line	Player	Ouch
2	action	The player loses 1-6 hitpoints.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player keeps their balance on the bridge:
2	box	You manage to keep your balance on the bridge.
2	action	The player gains 10 Agility experience.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player loses their balance on the bridge:
2	box	You fall!
2	line	Player	Ahhhhhhhhhh!
2	line	Player	Choke!
2	line	Player	Gulp!
2	line	Player	Cough!
2	box	You just manage to drag your pitiful frame onto the river bank.
2	box	Though you nearly drowned in the river!
2	action	The player loses 3-15 hitpoints.
2	line	Player	Gasp!
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Tinsay
1	line	Tinsay	Braaar! Tinsay's the name!
1	line	Player	Tinsay, I bring good news. Trufitus has communed with the gods - your village is once again safe.
1	line	Player	Your father requests that you return to the village.
1	line	Tinsay	I will return only once I have repaired the tribal statue. Bones!!
1	line	Player	Where is the tribal statue?
1	line	Tinsay	Just near my father's hut.
1	line	Player	But that's in the village!
1	line	Tinsay	I know.
1	line	Player	So what are you doing here?
1	line	Tinsay	I'm ... er ... collecting materials to repair the statue with.
1	line	Player	And I suppose you want me to fetch them for you?
1	line	Tinsay	Good idea! Yes!
1	line	Player	You mean you were just sitting here waiting for people to bring you things you need?
1	line	Tinsay	Yes...
1	line	Player	And you don't see anything wrong with that?
1	line	Tinsay	No...
1	line	Player	Right ... what do you need?
1	box	Tinsay pauses and then mutters to himself.
1	line	Tinsay	Hmm ... I think I need banana in Karamjan rum.
1	line	Player	I see. And you're going to use this to repair the statue?
1	line	Tinsay	But of course! Bwahaha!
1	line	Player	... I'll be back later.
1	action	end
1	cond	If the player uses a baited Karambwan vessel on Tinsay before helping him:
2	line	Player	Your brother Tiadeche has sent me. He asks you to study this vessel and produce crafting instructions.
2	line	Tinsay	You first help me, then I'll help you.
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Tinsay again
1	line	Tinsay	Have you found my banana in Karamjan rum yet?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Yes.
2	line	Player	Yes, I have it right here.
2	line	Tinsay	Well, hand it here then.
2	cond	If the player only has regular Karamjan rum or no rum:
3	option	Dialogue 1
4	line	Player	Erm ... I think I lost it in the wash.
4	action	continue
3	option	Dialogue 2
4	line	Player	Uh ... I think I left it in my other trousers.
4	action	continue
3	option	Dialogue 3
4	line	Player	Actually, my pet monkey ate it.
4	action	continue
2	cond	If the player has the Karamjan rum with a whole banana inside:
3	line	Player	Well, I have this.
3	box	You hand Tinsay the banana stuffed into Karamjan rum.
3	line	Tinsay	I can't use this - there is a banana blocking the bottle!
3	line	Tinsay	Find some way of actually getting the banana inside the bottle.
3	box	Tinsay hands you back the Karamjan rum.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player has the Karamjan rum with slices of banana inside it:
3	box	You hand Tinsay the sliced bananas in Karamjan rum.
3	line	Tinsay	Yes ... that's it! Hits just the spot!
3	line	Player	What? I thought you needed that for tribal statue repair!
3	line	Tinsay	I did!
3	line	Player	Can we return to the village now?
3	line	Tinsay	Not yet. I need one more thing...
3	line	Player	What is it?
3	line	Tinsay	I'm thinking...
3	action	Tinsay takes a second to ponder.
3	line	Tinsay	Seaweed ... Yes - a seaweed sandwich will do the trick.
3	line	Tinsay	Aha! A seaweed in monkey skin sandwich!
3	line	Player	Is this really necessary?
3	line	Tinsay	Yes. Essential.
3	line	Player	I'll be back later.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player doesn't have the rum:
3	select	Select an option
3	option	How do I ...
4	select	Select an option
4	option	... find Karamjan rum?
5	line	Player	How do I find Karamjan rum?
5	line	Tinsay	It's available in any respectable drinking establishment.
5	action	initial
4	option	... find bananas?
5	line	Player	How do I find bananas?
5	line	Tinsay	They grow everywhere!
5	action	initial
4	option	... convince you to return to the village?
5	line	Player	How do I convince you to return to the village?
5	line	Tinsay	Oblige me by fetching my drink.
5	action	initial
3	option	Just how insane are you?
4	line	Player	Just how insane are you?
4	option	Dialogue 1
5	line	Tinsay	On a scale of 1 to barmy , I'm about [#].
5	action	continue
