0	section	Talking to Tinsay again with his second request
1	line	Tinsay	Have you found my seaweed in monkey skin sandwich yet?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Yes.
2	line	Player	Yes, I have it right here.
2	line	Tinsay	Well, hand it here then.
2	cond	If the player has the seaweed sandwich:
3	box	You hand Tinsay the seaweed in monkey skin sandwich.
3	line	Tinsay	Yes ... perfect! You really do not understand how necessary that was.
3	line	Player	Can we go now?
3	line	Tinsay	Erm...
3	line	Player	...
3	line	Tinsay	...
3	line	Player	...
3	line	Tinsay	...
3	line	Player	Say something!
3	line	Tinsay	No!
3	line	Player	Does that mean you're not coming or not saying anything?
3	line	Tinsay	I'm not coming.
3	line	Player	Why?
3	line	Tinsay	I need one more thing... I need ... Jogre bones ...
3	line	Player	Jogre bones? Why do you keep-
3	line	Tinsay	Yes ... burnt Jogre bones.
3	line	Player	... burnt Jogre bones?? How am I-
3	line	Tinsay	Indeed. Burnt Jogre bones marinated in... Marinated in...
3	line	Player	Marinated???
3	line	Tinsay	Marinated in Karambwanji!
3	line	Player	...
3	line	Tinsay	Mmm ... Yes ... That will be good ...
3	line	Player	You're just going to eat it, aren't you?
3	line	Tinsay	No! Burnt Jogre bones marinated in Karambwanji are in fact essential in the trade of tribal statue repair!
3	line	Player	I'll be back ... eventually.
3	action	end
