0	section	Giving Tinsay the perfect Jogre bones
1	line	Tinsay	Have you found my burnt Jogre bones marinated in Karambwanji yet?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Yes.
2	cond	If the player gives him cooked and marinated Jogre bones as requested:
3	line	Player	Yes, I have it right here.
3	box	You hand Tinsay the burnt Jogre bones marinated in Karambwanji.
3	line	Tinsay	Finally! A near lifetime of craving satisfied!
3	line	Player	I assume you're now able to repair the statue...
3	line	Tinsay	Perfectly able, my friend, thanks to your ministrations!
3	line	Tinsay	Probably best you don't go cooking any more Karambwanji from now on, they can be a bit volatile!
3	line	Player	Will you return to the village now?
3	line	Tinsay	Must I ... ?
3	line	Player	I insist - and so does your father.
3	line	Tinsay	He will not be pleased with me...
3	line	Player	Why?
3	line	Tinsay	It's complicated - we don't really talk about it.
3	line	Tinsay	Very well. I will meet you in the village once you have helped my brothers and spoken to my father.
3	action	end
1	option	No.
2	action	above
