0	section	Talking to Tinsay
1	line	Tinsay	Braaar! Your meals are truly excellent, Bwana...
1	line	Player	I'm glad to hear it.
1	line	Tinsay	... but as a cook, you clearly have much to learn! Now, I have been attempting to cook the Karambwan. As we all know, they are poisonous if not cooked properly.
1	line	Player	Yes. It's how I, or rather Tamayu, killed the Shaikahan.
1	line	Tinsay	Indeed. I have determined precisely how to cook them for so that they become edible. I finally got around to repairing that statue too!
1	box	Tinsay trains you in cooking technique. You learn how to cook Karambwan properly.
1	action	The player gains 5,000 Cooking experience.
1	line	Tinsay	Oh, and before you go... Jogre bones!
1	line	Player	Okay...
1	action	end
